{"text":"Señorita, bu de bu de, de shomei. You know what I mean. So, everybody said, by the way, how much better a dancer Michelle was than me, which hurt my feelings a little bit. On a more personal level, India represents an intersection of two men who've always inspired me. When Reverend Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. was protesting racial segregation in the United States, he said that his guiding light was Mahatma Gandhi. When Dr. King came to India, he said that being here in Gandhi's land reaffirmed his conviction that in the struggle for justice and human dignity, the most potent weapon of all is nonviolent resistance. And those two great souls are why we can gather here today, Indians and Americans, equal and free.","words":[{"text":"Señorita","start":0.82,"end":1.4,"punct":","},{"text":"bu","start":2.46,"end":2.62},{"text":"de","start":2.62,"end":2.76},{"text":"bu","start":2.76,"end":2.88},{"text":"de","start":2.88,"end":3.72,"punct":","},{"text":"de","start":4.18,"end":4.5},{"text":"shomei","start":4.5,"end":5.66,"punct":"."},{"text":"You","start":5.74,"end":6.18},{"text":"know","start":6.18,"end":6.42},{"text":"what","start":6.42,"end":6.54},{"text":"I","start":6.54,"end":6.66},{"text":"mean","start":6.66,"end":6.86,"punct":"."},{"text":"So","start":16.76,"end":17.34,"punct":","},{"text":"everybody","start":17.34,"end":17.92},{"text":"said","start":17.92,"end":18.28,"punct":","},{"text":"by","start":18.38,"end":18.46},{"text":"the","start":18.46,"end":18.56},{"text":"way","start":18.56,"end":18.68,"punct":","},{"text":"how","start":18.7,"end":18.86},{"text":"much","start":18.86,"end":19.04},{"text":"better","start":19.04,"end":19.36},{"text":"a","start":19.36,"end":19.66},{"text":"dancer","start":19.66,"end":20.0},{"text":"Michelle","start":20.0,"end":20.58},{"text":"was","start":20.58,"end":20.88},{"text":"than","start":20.88,"end":21.04},{"text":"me","start":21.04,"end":21.22,"punct":","},{"text":"which","start":21.66,"end":22.26},{"text":"hurt","start":22.